data: {"id": "94f1288505064d4f-thinking-parallel_evidence-2388", "run_id": "94f1288505064d4f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突和缺口说明如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462`\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-08`\n- **UID**: `7f2eda43-58bc-4f48-bb8a-02435553f7d1`\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.11`\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **容器**: `app` (`xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)\n- **控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-5c9c7b6489`\n\n身份与生命周期事实已确认，后续所有证据均基于此实体。\n\n### 2. 支持 CrashLoopBackOff 根因的证据\n- **kubectl_describe (直接证据)**: 容器 `app` 的状态显示：\n    - `Reason: OOMKilled`\n    - `Exit Code: 137` (通常表示进程被系统 SIGKILL，在容器", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789083101782, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

