data: {"id": "94f1288505064d4f-final", "run_id": "94f1288505064d4f", "seq": 2393, "ts_ms": 1789083123032, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，Container app 重启 19 次 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | container.last_terminated_reason: `OOMKilled` | 直接证明容器因内存超限被系统终止 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Exit Code: `137`, Reason: `CrashLoopBackOff` | 佐证进程被强制杀掉，且重启策略触发 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | container.resource_limit.memory: `64Mi` | 提供触发 OOM 的硬性限制基准 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | container_memory_working_set_bytes: max `66244608` bytes (~63.1Mi) | 内存工作集持续逼近 64Mi 限制 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | /work 请求日志中 allocated_mib: `10` -> `48` (last) | 日志确认特定请求处理中内存分配持续增加 |\n\n**证据关联分析：**\nKubernetes 状态确认了“OOMKilled (137)”的终止原因（#1, #2），结合资源限制配置（#3），说明内存不足是直接原因。Metric 观测到峰值内存达到 63.1Mi，极其接近 64Mi 的限制（#4），证实限制被触及。Logging 中 /work 接口处理期间分配的内存从 10Mi 增至 48Mi（#5），揭示了具体的内存增长来源。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nMemory Limit 64Mi 设置过低 → /work 业务请求处理导致内存持续分配 → 内存使用量逼近/突破限制 → 触发 OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) → Pod CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：容器 `app` 配置的内存硬限制 `64Mi`（`fact-986d24039993`）无法满足应用在处理 `/work` 请求时的内存需求。\n\n证据表明，应用在处理请求时内存分配持续增长，日志显示单次处理涉及的内存分配最高达 48Mi（`fact-1fd114f38ff8` 等），且观测到的内存工作集峰值达到约 63.1Mi（`fact-225dd86f466d`），这直接触发了 Kubernetes 的 OOM Killer（`fact-0802a8cb2598`）。进程退出码 137（`fact-3da8302ff375`）与 OOMKilled 状态一致，并引发了容器的反复重启和 CrashLoopBackOff 状态（`fact-a2bb3b44ecc5`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 89.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462: 89.9s (Evidence 78.6s, RCA 11.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 114.913, "metrics": {"run_id": "94f1288505064d4f", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 114.91923975944519, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 114919.23975944519, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 80166.5141582489, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 95517.13371276855, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 34327.2647857666}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15182.677030563354, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 89889.1248703003, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9825.834512710571, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

